  "referenceNumber": "RUS1659",
  "remarks": "\nIgor Anatolievich YEGOROV is the Military Commissar of the Rostov region, Russian Federation. YEGOROV is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because he is or has engaged in policies or actions which destabilise Ukraine and undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine.\n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
